.\n\nOkpareke has struggled with disclosure questions, with reports that her ad spending was omitted from her federal campaign finance report. Prediction markets price the Democrat at about 98 percent, and the race draws no attention from expert raters. The forecast expects Stansbury to win by roughly 20 points, consistent with the district's fundamentals and the incumbent's financial advantage.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9867, "margin": 19.44}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9859, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.985, "margin": 19.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9862, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9827, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9841, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9855, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9883, "margin": 19.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9876, "margin": 19.6}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9849, "margin": 19.6}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9867, "margin": 19.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9862, "margin": 19.6}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9858, "margin": 19.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9878, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9864, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9873, "margin": 19.6}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9836, "margin": 19.6}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9821, "margin": 19.6}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9849, "margin": 19.6}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9868, "margin": 19.6}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9893, "margin": 19.6}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9878, "margin": 19.6}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9828, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.9834, "margin": 19.6}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.9711, "margin": 17.0}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.9868, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.9847, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-19", "p_dem": 0.9788, "margin"